--TEST--
order class members puts an attribute declaration in the first group, above a property, `rule:tooling/class-members-have-one-order`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Shop
{
    private int $<|>count = 0;

    attribute Job on method { queue: string }
}
--REQUEST--
codeAction only=source.orderMembers.nvs
--EXPECT--
4:5-6:46 source.orderMembers.nvs Order class members -> "attribute Job on method { queue: string }\n    private int $count = 0;"
